WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.780
I would spend some time on testing

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:06.960
the priority workflows from the old GPTs
and making

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.780
sure that they still produce the desired
results in the plugin,

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:12.940
and then modify the instructions if not,

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:15.600
and then finally share these new plugins
with your team.
